might be the stuff of some guys' fantasies, but when the suddenly effeminatized Natsuru is informed by a stuffed tiger that he's now a Kampfer, a mystical fighter who has to fight other Kampfers in female form, his life becomes a living nightmare!\n\nPutting aside the obvious \"plumbing\" issues, Natusru's best childhood friend turns out to swing the other way and SHE has a crush on his new female body. Not complex enough? Natsuru's school has separate sections for boys and girls, so he and she are now double enrolled. The rumor-mill has it that he's dating herself. And there are other Kampfers attending the school who want to take her out, and he's not sure which ones mean \"on a date\" and which ones mean \"permanently.\" Oh, and did we mention that some Kampfers use swords and gun?! Hormones, fists, and other body parts will fly as the daring, new gender-blender defender must become a contender or die!\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Henshin","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gender Bending","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Musical Theater","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Meta","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kemonomimi","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Idol","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Yuri","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Guns","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cute Girls Doing Cute Things","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Kämpfer","english":"Kämpfer","native":"けんぷファー","romaji":"Kämpfer","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"肯普法"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"けんぷファー フュア ディ リーヴェ"}]},"trailer":{"id":"dXzjfpCtFYs","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dXzjfpC